{
  "name": "Transcripción de Instagram via Telegram (@CronistaYT_bot)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎬 Transcripción de Instagram via Telegram\n\n### Solo necesitas hacer esto (1 minuto):\n\n**1.** En cada nodo rojo → toca → elige la credencial de Telegram que ya tienes (`CronistaYT Bot`)\n\n**2.** En el nodo **\"Transcribir con Whisper\"** → elige tu credencial de OpenAI\n\n**3.** Activa el workflow (toggle arriba a la derecha)\n\n**4.** Copia la URL del webhook del nodo Telegram Trigger y regístrala:\n`https://api.telegram.org/bot{TOKEN}/setWebhook?url={WEBHOOK_URL}`\n\n### Sin API keys extra — usa Cobalt (gratis) para descargar Instagram\n\n### Uso:\n- Envía cualquier link de Instagram al bot @CronistaYT_bot\n- Funciona con Reels, posts con video e IGTV",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "📋 Setup (leer primero)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": ["message"],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [200, 300],
      "webhookId": "cronista-instagram-transcripcion"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const message = $input.first().json?.message || {};\nconst text = message?.text || message?.caption || '';\nconst chat_id = message?.chat?.id;\nconst message_id = message?.message_id;\n\nconst instagramRegex = /https?:\\/\\/(www\\.)?(instagram\\.com|instagr\\.am)\\/[^\\s]+/gi;\nconst matches = text.match(instagramRegex);\nconst url = matches ? matches[0].replace(/[.,;!?:)\"']+$/, '') : null;\n\nreturn [{ json: { url, chat_id, message_id } }];"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Extraer URL de Instagram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [420, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-has-url",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.url }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "¿Es URL de Instagram?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [640, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "⏳ Descargando y transcribiendo el video... Dame unos segundos.",
        "additionalFields": { "reply_to_message_id": "={{ $json.message_id }}" }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Enviar: Procesando",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [860, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "❌ No encontré un link de Instagram.\n\nEjemplo válido:\n`https://www.instagram.com/reel/ABC123/`",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "reply_to_message_id": "={{ $json.message_id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
      "name": "Error: No es Instagram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [860, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.cobalt.tools/",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"url\": \"{{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.url }}\",\n  \"downloadMode\": \"auto\"\n}",
        "options": { "timeout": 30000 }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
      "name": "Obtener Video via Cobalt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1080, 160],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "❌ No pude descargar el video. El post puede ser privado o no tener video.",
        "additionalFields": {
          "reply_to_message_id": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.message_id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008",
      "name": "Error: No se pudo descargar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1300, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.first().json;\nconst status = data.status;\n\nlet videoUrl = null;\n\nif (status === 'stream' || status === 'redirect' || status === 'tunnel') {\n  videoUrl = data.url;\n} else if (status === 'picker') {\n  const videoItem = (data.picker || []).find(p => p.type === 'video') || data.picker?.[0];\n  videoUrl = videoItem?.url;\n}\n\nif (!videoUrl) {\n  throw new Error(`Cobalt no encontró video. Status: ${status || 'desconocido'}`);\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  videoUrl,\n  chat_id: $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.chat_id,\n  message_id: $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.message_id\n}}];"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009",
      "name": "Extraer URL del Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1300, 160],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "❌ Este post no tiene video. Solo puedo transcribir Reels y videos, no imágenes.",
        "additionalFields": {
          "reply_to_message_id": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.message_id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
      "name": "Error: Sin video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1520, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.videoUrl }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          },
          "redirect": { "redirect": { "followRedirects": true, "maxRedirects": 5 } },
          "timeout": 90000
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011",
      "name": "Descargar Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1520, 160],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "❌ Fallo al descargar el archivo. Intenta de nuevo.",
        "additionalFields": {
          "reply_to_message_id": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.message_id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012",
      "name": "Error: Descarga fallida",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1740, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/audio/transcriptions",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "parameterType": "formBinaryData", "name": "file", "inputDataFieldName": "data" },
            { "name": "model", "value": "whisper-1" },
            { "name": "response_format", "value": "json" }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "timeout": 180000 }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000013",
      "name": "Transcribir con Whisper",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1740, 160],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "❌ No pude transcribir el audio. El video puede no tener voz o ser demasiado largo (límite 25 MB).",
        "additionalFields": {
          "reply_to_message_id": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.message_id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014",
      "name": "Error: Transcripción fallida",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1960, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const transcription = $input.first().json?.text || '';\n\nif (!transcription.trim()) throw new Error('Transcripción vacía');\n\nconst MAX = 3800;\nconst header = '📝 *Transcripción del video de Instagram:*\\n\\n';\nconst footer = '\\n\\n_Transcrito con Whisper AI_ 🤖';\n\nconst full = header + transcription + footer;\nif (full.length <= MAX) return [{ json: { text: full } }];\n\n// Split long transcriptions\nconst words = transcription.split(' ');\nconst chunks = [];\nlet current = '';\nfor (const word of words) {\n  if ((current + ' ' + word).length > MAX) {\n    if (current) chunks.push(current.trim());\n    current = word;\n  } else {\n    current += (current ? ' ' : '') + word;\n  }\n}\nif (current.trim()) chunks.push(current.trim());\n\nreturn chunks.map((chunk, i) => ({\n  json: {\n    text: (i === 0 ? header : `📝 *...parte ${i + 1}/${chunks.length}:*\\n\\n`) +\n          chunk +\n          (i === chunks.length - 1 ? footer : '')\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000015",
      "name": "Formatear Transcripción",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1960, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "reply_to_message_id": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.message_id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000016",
      "name": "Enviar Transcripción",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [2180, 160]
    }
  ],
